ta></metadata></head><body dur="3:48.523"><div begin="19.191" end="23.544" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.191" end="23.544" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.191" end="19.720">화</span><span begin="20.380" end="20.572">약</span> <span begin="20.572" end="20.830">연</span><span begin="20.830" end="21.052">기</span> <span begin="21.052" end="21.514">뒤</span><span begin="21.974" end="22.232">덮</span><span begin="22.232" end="22.475">인</span> <span begin="22.475" end="22.678">하</span><span begin="22.678" end="22.940">늘</span> <span begin="22.940" end="23.544">봐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看 那被硝烟吞噬的天空</span></p></div><div begin="26.590" end="32.589" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="26.590" end="32.589" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.590" end="27.001">몇</span><span begin="27.448" end="27.777">십</span> <span begin="27.777" end="28.003">년</span> <span begin="28.003" end="28.168">후</span><span begin="28.168" end="28.450">쯤</span><span begin="28.450" end="28.999">이</span> <span begin="29.563" end="29.908">되</span><span begin="29.908" end="30.088">어</span><span begin="30.088" end="30.369">야</span> <span begin="30.369" end="30.797">우</span><span begin="30.797" end="31.011">리</span><span begin="31.011" end="31.206">는</span> <span begin="31.206" end="31.452">전</span><span begin="31.452" end="31.659">설</span><span begin="31.659" end="31.871">이</span> <span begin="31.871" end="32.145">될</span><span begin="32.145" end="32.589">까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">究竟要再过几十年 我们才能化作传说？</span></p></div><div begin="33.851" end="38.122" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="33.851" end="38.122" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.851" end="34.427">슝</span> <span begin="34.913" end="35.157">폭</span><span begin="35.157" end="35.388">탄</span><span begin="35.388" end="35.595">과</span> <span begin="35.595" end="35.889">총</span><span begin="35.889" end="36.264">알</span> <span begin="36.543" end="36.798">날</span><span begin="36.798" end="36.981">아</span><span begin="36.981" end="37.176">가</span><span begin="37.176" end="37.434">는</span> <span begin="37.434" end="37.680">모</span><span begin="37.680" end="38.122">양</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“咻——” 炮弹与流弹划破天际的轨迹</span></p></div><div begin="41.312" end="47.336" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="41.312" end="47.336" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.312" end="41.886">얼</span><span begin="42.299" end="42.546">마</span><span begin="42.546" end="42.765">나</span> <span begin="42.765" end="42.983">시</span><span begin="42.983" end="43.254">간</span><span begin="43.254" end="43.679">이</span> <span begin="44.315" end="44.649">지</span><span begin="44.649" end="44.841">나</span><span begin="44.841" end="45.047">야</span> <span begin="45.047" end="45.540">이</span><span begin="45.540" end="45.815">들</span><span begin="45.815" end="45.997">이</span> <span begin="45.997" end="46.235">폭</span><span begin="46.235" end="46.454">죽</span><span begin="46.454" end="46.661">이</span> <span begin="46.661" end="46.916">될</span><span begin="46.916" end="47.336">까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">究竟还要熬过多少岁月 它们才会变成庆典的烟火？</span></p></div><div begin="48.450" end="51.127" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.450" end="51.127" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="48.450" end="48.763">피</span><span begin="48.763" end="48.994">가</span> <span begin="48.994" end="49.229">나</span><span begin="49.229" end="49.454">는</span> <span begin="49.454" end="49.678">줄</span><span begin="49.678" end="49.922">도</span> <span begin="49.922" end="50.165">모</span><span begin="50.165" end="50.393">르</span><span begin="50.393" end="51.127">고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连鲜血浸透衣衫都浑然不觉</span></p></div><div begin="52.210" end="55.663" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="52.210" end="55.663" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="52.210" end="52.474">걸</span><span begin="52.474" end="52.706">음</span><span begin="52.706" end="52.910">을</span> <span begin="52.910" end="53.131">빨</span><span begin="53.131" end="53.373">리</span> <span begin="53.373" end="53.827">재</span><span begin="53.827" end="54.007">촉</span><span begin="54.007" end="54.562">하</span><span begin="54.562" end="54.775">는</span> <span begin="54.775" end="54.955">당</span><span begin="54.955" end="55.214">신</span><span begin="55.214" end="55.663">은</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只顾匆匆赶路的你啊</span></p></div><div begin="55.888" end="59.420" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="55.888" end="59.420" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="55.888" end="56.133">어</span><span begin="56.133" end="56.343">떤</span> <span begin="56.343" end="56.626">것</span><span begin="56.626" end="56.851">을</span> <span begin="56.851" end="57.037">그</span><span begin="57.037" end="57.547">토</span><span begin="57.547" end="57.718">록</span> <span begin="57.718" end="58.165">사</span><span begin="58.165" end="58.429">랑</span><span begin="58.429" end="58.667">하</span><span begin="58.667" end="58.961">길</span><span begin="58.961" end="59.420">래</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">究竟是因为深爱着什么</span></p></div><div begin="59.574" end="1:03.107" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="59.574" end="1:03.107" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="59.574" end="59.879">몇</span> <span begin="59.879" end="1:00.090">번</span><span begin="1:00.090" end="1:00.306">을</span> <span begin="1:00.306" end="1:00.530">살</span><span begin="1:00.530" end="1:00.746">아</span><span begin="1:00.746" end="1:01.219">났</span><span begin="1:01.219" end="1:01.491">나</span><span begin="1:01.491" end="1:03.107">요</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">才一次次死里逃生</span></p></div><div begin="1:03.032" end="1:05.846" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:03.032" end="1:05.846" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:03.032" end="1:03.493">Hey</span> <span begin="1:03.493" end="1:04.007">kid,</span> <span begin="1:04.384" end="1:04.691">close</span> <span begin="1:04.691" end="1:05.147">your</span> <span begin="1:05.147" end="1:05.846">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">孩子 快闭上眼睛</span></p></div><div begin="1:06.692" end="1:10.032" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:06.692" end="1:10.032" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:06.692" end="1:07.239">답</span><span begin="1:07.239" end="1:07.677">답</span><span begin="1:07.677" end="1:08.048">해</span><span begin="1:08.048" end="1:08.156">도</span> <span begin="1:08.156" end="1:08.414">조</span><span begin="1:08.414" end="1:08.812">금</span><span begin="1:08.812" end="1:09.291">만</span> <span begin="1:09.291" end="1:09.795">참</span><span begin="1:09.795" end="1:10.032">아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算觉得窒息 也请再忍耐一下</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.408" end="1:13.983" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:10.408" end="1:13.983" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:10.408" end="1:10.926">여</span><span begin="1:10.926" end="1:11.415">기</span> <span begin="1:11.799" end="1:12.081">전</span><span begin="1:12.081" end="1:12.531">쟁</span><span begin="1:12.531" end="1:12.984">터</span><span begin="1:12.984" end="1:13.437">에</span><span begin="1:13.437" end="1:13.983">선</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为在这片修罗场上</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.364" end="1:15.901" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:14.364" end="1:15.901" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:14.364" end="1:14.658">이</span><span begin="1:14.658" end="1:14.859">명</span><span begin="1:14.859" end="1:15.082">이</span> <span begin="1:15.082" end="1:15.279">끝</span><span begin="1:15.279" end="1:15.531">나</span><span begin="1:15.531" end="1:15.901">면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当耳鸣消散之后</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.188" end="1:18.658" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:16.188" end="1:18.658" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:16.188" end="1:16.452">비</span><span begin="1:16.452" end="1:16.689">명</span><span begin="1:16.689" end="1:16.896">이</span> <span begin="1:16.896" end="1:17.106">들</span><span begin="1:17.106" end="1:17.364">릴</span> <span begin="1:17.364" end="1:17.865">테</span><span begin="1:17.865" end="1:18.072">니</span><span begin="1:18.072" end="1:18.658">까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">迎来的便是凄厉的悲鸣</span></p></div><div begin="1:23.339" end="1:25.156" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:23.339" end="1:25.156" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.339" end="1:23.876">Hey</span> <span begin="1:23.876" end="1:24.313">kid,</span> <span begin="1:24.313" end="1:24.770">hey</span> <span begin="1:24.770" end="1:25.156">kid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">孩子啊 孩子</span></p></div><div begin="1:25.214" end="1:26.162" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:25.214" end="1:26.162" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:25.214" end="1:25.692">Hey</span> <span begin="1:25.692" end="1:26.162">kid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">孩子啊</span></p></div><div begin="1:33.012" end="1:37.684" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:33.012" end="1:37.684" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.012" end="1:33.519">내</span> <span begin="1:34.128" end="1:34.414">어</span><span begin="1:34.414" end="1:34.681">깨</span> <span begin="1:34.681" end="1:34.903">위</span><span begin="1:34.903" end="1:35.401">로</span> <span begin="1:36.058" end="1:36.321">팔</span><span begin="1:36.321" end="1:36.523">을</span> <span begin="1:36.523" end="1:36.991">감</span><span begin="1:36.991" end="1:37.684">아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把手臂搭在我的肩上</span></p></div><div begin="1:40.385" end="1:46.519" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:40.385" end="1:46.519" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.385" end="1:41.056">저</span><span begin="1:41.564" end="1:41.837">들</span><span begin="1:41.837" end="1:42.029">이</span> <span begin="1:42.029" end="1:42.341">가</span><span begin="1:42.341" end="1:42.788">면</span> <span begin="1:43.393" end="1:43.651">부</span><span begin="1:43.651" end="1:43.858">축</span><span begin="1:43.858" end="1:44.080">해</span> <span begin="1:44.080" end="1:44.608">줄</span> <span begin="1:44.608" end="1:44.854">테</span><span begin="1:44.854" end="1:45.022">니</span> <span begin="1:45.022" end="1:45.259">서</span><span begin="1:45.259" end="1:45.490">둘</span><span begin="1:45.490" end="1:45.709">러</span> <span begin="1:45.709" end="1:45.960">가</span><span begin="1:45.960" end="1:46.519">자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">等他们走远我便搀着你 让我们快点离开这里吧</span></p></div><div begin="1:47.766" end="1:52.040" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:47.766" end="1:52.040" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.766" end="1:48.349">쿵</span> <span begin="1:48.738" end="1:49.005">건</span><span begin="1:49.005" end="1:49.207">물</span><span begin="1:49.207" end="1:49.408">과</span> <span begin="1:49.408" end="1:49.648">동</span><span begin="1:49.648" end="1:50.199">상</span> <span begin="1:50.345" end="1:50.609">쓰</span><span begin="1:50.609" end="1:50.808">러</span><span begin="1:50.808" end="1:51.051">지</span><span begin="1:51.051" end="1:51.252">는</span> <span begin="1:51.252" end="1:51.507">모</span><span begin="1:51.507" end="1:52.040">양</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“轰——” 高楼与雕像轰然坍塌的剪影</span></p></div><div begin="1:55.153" end="2:01.295" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:55.153" end="2:01.295" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.153" end="1:55.802">돈</span><span begin="1:56.083" end="1:56.366">보</span><span begin="1:56.366" end="1:56.528">다</span> <span begin="1:56.528" end="1:56.801">사</span><span begin="1:56.801" end="1:57.091">랑</span><span begin="1:57.091" end="1:57.587">이</span> <span begin="1:58.240" end="1:58.474">필</span><span begin="1:58.474" end="1:58.678">요</span><span begin="1:58.678" end="1:58.868">한</span> <s